1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,184
Hey everyone, welcome back to Car Service
Podcast.

2
00:00:03,534 --> 00:00:07,278
I'm Sam, and today we're talking power
steering oil changes.

3
00:00:07,628 --> 00:00:10,700
Our guest, Raj, just had his done at
Golden Horse.

4
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:13,714
Hi, thanks for having me.

5
00:00:14,063 --> 00:00:15,839
Great to have you, Raj.

6
00:00:16,189 --> 00:00:17,821
So, what brought you in?

7
00:00:18,171 --> 00:00:22,347
A warning light on the dash and a weird
whine when turning.

8
00:00:22,697 --> 00:00:25,193
A whine? That sounds annoying.

9
00:00:25,543 --> 00:00:28,831
Yeah, it got louder on tight corners.

10
00:00:29,181 --> 00:00:30,021
How did you book?

11
00:00:30,371 --> 00:00:34,283
Online at golden-horse.ae, took a minute.

12
00:00:34,633 --> 00:00:37,057
Nice, the site is pretty straightforward.

13
00:00:37,406 --> 00:00:39,974
When you arrived at Al Quoz, what was the
vibe?

14
00:00:40,324 --> 00:00:44,428
Clean workshop, friendly reception, felt
professional.

15
00:00:44,778 --> 00:00:46,626
Did they explain the diagnosis?

16
00:00:46,976 --> 00:00:50,456
They checked the fluid, said it was dark
and low.

17
00:00:50,806 --> 00:00:51,574
And the fix?

18
00:00:51,924 --> 00:00:55,668
Full fluid flush and refill, took about an
hour.

19
00:00:56,018 --> 00:00:58,250
Only an hour? That's quick.

20
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,712
Yep, they were efficient.

21
00:01:01,061 --> 00:01:02,573
How does the steering feel now?

22
00:01:02,923 --> 00:01:06,355
Smooth, no noise, light as new.

23
00:01:06,705 --> 00:01:08,241
No surprises on the bill?

24
00:01:08,591 --> 00:01:13,583
Exactly, they quoted 350 AED up front.

25
00:01:13,933 --> 00:01:15,517
That matches the listed price.

26
00:01:15,867 --> 00:01:17,091
Glad it worked out.

27
00:01:17,441 --> 00:01:20,177
Totally worth it, peace of mind.

28
00:01:20,527 --> 00:01:22,903
Now, Omar joins us for a quick tip.

29
00:01:23,252 --> 00:01:24,164
Sure thing.

30
00:01:24,514 --> 00:01:27,802
Omar, what are early signs my brakes need
attention?

31
00:01:28,152 --> 00:01:32,256
Golden Horse offers brake service; any
squeak or pull means a check.

32
00:01:32,606 --> 00:01:33,398
Good to know.

33
00:01:33,748 --> 00:01:35,116
Myth busting time.

34
00:01:35,466 --> 00:01:38,250
Myth: power steering fluid never needs
changing.

35
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:41,696
False — regular changes keep steering
responsive.

36
00:01:42,046 --> 00:01:44,278
Exactly, the workshop recommends it.

37
00:01:44,627 --> 00:01:46,427
Now, a quick giveaway.

38
00:01:46,777 --> 00:01:49,489
Golden Horse is giving away a free car
health check.

39
00:01:49,839 --> 00:01:52,191
Just subscribe and comment your car model.

40
00:01:52,541 --> 00:01:56,069
Entry is free, winner announced later on
our show and their socials.

41
00:01:56,419 --> 00:01:57,571
Thanks for listening.

42
00:01:57,921 --> 00:02:01,137
Book your next service at golden-horse.ae,
Dubai.

43
00:02:01,487 --> 00:02:02,807
See you next time.
